ri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75295893_1122035958805707_3976827415305179869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fk2DqKekLdoQ7kNvwFj9WI1&_nc_oc=AdozTqaaUz2VSIkNf49H1FGoQwehmBSxXOdK8aoQkY_xs3XbhSDxLMSa_tBEd60VpD0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Ml7y6t5D3REpssQlgf4e4ts3EPhQgr4ZCmxbXlm-TWQ&oe=69FDF981"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO3.png", "id": "285314937333520", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035431_285314940666853_7917901485208087798_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CI_3wm2XW48Q7kNvwGsEzgj&_nc_oc=AdoaeNEycWFBZy7vR_FtM1HSb6QBgpT4Auk3obd3Cx1-BU_pCZisMSRtKe0Mazz9KUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4Q08zVpSKKeEyRy7Eg3cHUxYIoIQJA-vlab1Ko8aThbg&oe=69FDEAE6"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO5.png", "id": "381136241036217", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982584_381136244369550_483176816840528973_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zc5TV3sLQm8Q7kNvwGkPrk6&_nc_oc=Adp7QOUqhUvaVsIHkoMfSchsax_HzXPgDiyz-8skiUpis9owOl1_Q55Mj9DD7SdRKA4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7vVks4MCeE1BaTElCr-j1XqmH19OBWB5Ehh3aOoUHzEw&oe=69FDFB7A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO6.png", "id": "2169394943393371", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2169394946726704_833013698734162480_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4gsOGp5DzzoQ7kNvwGuLZIg&_nc_oc=Adpxp8_x7RlpOWH38PBp64pQpz2uXdz0zr2x1mI5-rvakY1Ei4ZuF1WwxgVZgkV24D0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4Fxrvxkui3smV1SpPa4mLxsEGK_nP1aTvB42choGv-OQ&oe=69FDFD4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image.png", "id": "1048298189708781", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003240_1048298193042114_5639017989450219791_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3PLOdQ2k07sQ7kNvwHOta0a&_nc_oc=AdpCBqhidPVvkA94iB09EMjux6L5XQFYPbU-gAaMw43Qkr7bciwZHT1YX6GeyBNP67s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7WzsTwbKWkQ7qUAe7SOvYLJrCO9xKgLMvVxFttZC8Emg&oe=69FDF87D"}, "display_name": "VROO 360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VROO est une solution cl\u00e9-en-main pour pr\u00e9senter des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre public sur les appareils Meta Quest. Notre agence vous accompagne dans la cr\u00e9ation d\u2019un programme VR parfait pour votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement !\n> S\u00e9lectionnez vos films dans notre catalogue. VROO offre plus de 30 exp\u00e9riences (Fiction, Documentaire, Exp\u00e9rimental, Nature & D\u00e9couverte, Enfants, etc.) ;\n> Lancer l\u2019application et t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez vos films en utilisant un code PIN;\n> Profitez de votre application VROO personnalis\u00e9e : Une interface simple et ergonomique en mode kiosque qui permet \u00e0 vos spectateurs de d\u00e9marrer les films en utilisant leur regard.\n\nPour plus d\u2019informations, contactez notre \u00e9quipe :  hello@diversioncinema.com\n\n\nVROO is a simple solution to showcase 360\u00b0 movies to your audience on Meta Quest devices. Our agency helps you build the perfect VR program for your event!\n> Choose your movies from our catalog. VROO offers more than 30 experiences (Fiction, Documentary, Experimental, Nature & Discovery, Kids, etc.);\n> Launch the application and download your movies using a pin code;\n> Enjoy your personalized VROO app: A simple and ergonomic interface in kiosk mode that allows your spectators to play the movies using their gaze. \nFor more information, contact our team: hello@diversioncinema.com", "short_description": "Pr\u00e9sentez des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre publique en toute simplicit\u00e9 !\nThe easiest way to showcase 360 VR movies to your audience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroo.io/Legal-Notice", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Diversion cinem